<title>ITALY: Fiat's Snia trims 1st half pre-tax loss.</title>
<headline>Fiat's Snia trims 1st half pre-tax loss.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Turnover			    547.5 (down 3.4 percent)</p>
<p>    Operating result			19.1  (up 2.7 percent)</p>
<p>    Loss before tax and interest	 3.1  vs 5.9 loss</p>
<p>Note - Raggruppamento Fibre di Snia Bpd is a unit of Fiat . The company said in a statement first half performance was affected by a sharp slowdown across Europe.</p>
<p>It said net debt stood at 488.4 billion lire compared with 480.9 billion at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
